            <div xml:id="m-e0b6e910-e5d2-450e-86ea-bd7adf699f98">
              <lg xml:id="m-f7dc8eaa-48ca-4541-84c5-ce1330cb8a93">
                <l xml:id="m-0aab3361-5c9e-4959-9c1e-613ce332caae" facs="#m-92db2874-8874-4df2-b06e-8d457fb5c71d" label="text-like">The Mass at Dawn.</l><l xml:id="m-d07bb8d3-14cf-4eb2-b55f-ffa446997a51" facs="#m-b3534052-eecb-462a-848c-25d0d6af3dc4" label="ambiguous">403</l><l xml:id="m-7f957201-42dc-433b-9321-0ef4a754a4ad" facs="#m-0163bc05-6b36-4342-ab50-3316635f5243" label="lyrics-like">3. Sicut locútus est per os sanetórum, * qui a saéculo sunt, prophetá¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f1331b8-3f83-4421-809a-462131234b70" facs="#m-9061539e-faa9-44c7-bbf2-356f49924bde" label="lyrics-like">rum éjus:</l><l xml:id="m-a4910698-c460-4693-8ae0-79173d9d4671" facs="#m-6c939f39-6d40-4dc1-b754-70b965f43024" label="lyrics-like">4. Salútem ex inimicis nóstris, * et de mánu ómnium qui odérunt nos:</l><l xml:id="m-52b4b07c-37e2-4502-8117-a2623d71d1cf" facs="#m-134160ef-c9c5-46c5-93dc-3a6df5c7fc5a" label="lyrics-like">5. Ad faciéndam misericórdiam cum pátribus nóstris:*et memorári</l><l xml:id="m-282e2128-26fa-4b71-8b34-f29854917aa2" facs="#m-57b3a876-d162-4211-a0bc-517238a903c1" label="lyrics-like">testaménti sút sáncti.</l><l xml:id="m-dfabff10-9050-4c8d-b985-94829846eec2" facs="#m-19ca4960-b64c-4744-923d-a05f2a3ba540" label="lyrics-like">6. Jusjurándum, quod jurávit ad Abraham pátrem nóstrum, * datúrum</l><l xml:id="m-88351715-38a7-4ad3-b16b-84a3d1d054e6" facs="#m-4e2df55f-4b02-486d-bce7-f5460bcec013" label="lyrics-like">se nóbis:</l><l xml:id="m-c239f250-36ec-4550-a317-65aa47868991" facs="#m-e73ccc06-c8e6-4fab-9801-df04d7a27fe0" label="lyrics-like">7. Ut sine timóre de mánu inimicórum nostrórum liberáti, *serviá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7fe3d094-4d39-4d80-af4c-5f88aa6e9236" facs="#m-cbed9e14-8965-4778-a8c5-c36a7fed0871" label="ambiguous">mus illi:</l><l xml:id="m-c09d93c3-b437-4328-91e0-db283061ff9a" facs="#m-74d07a2c-13bf-440d-817c-1b020b8abc2a" label="lyrics-like">8. In sanctitáte et justítia coram ipso, *ómnibus diébus nóstris.</l><l xml:id="m-d5ad5576-fe42-4524-9d03-ff9fde770ecb" facs="#m-7ed34f30-1039-4b74-873a-13b501a03491" label="lyrics-like">9. Et tu púer, prophéta Altissimi vocáberis: *praeibis enim ante</l><l xml:id="m-412de75d-3580-4854-a5d8-a14d81fef9ff" facs="#m-93b92711-98b6-4e33-8ff5-01b2f4072801" label="lyrics-like">fáciem Dómini paráre vias éjus:</l><l xml:id="m-8fda0665-e82e-4489-99f2-3446850e964d" facs="#m-45d32058-02aa-420e-af0a-ba4e7b823256" label="lyrics-like">10. Ad dándam sciéntiam salútis plébi éjus, *in remissiónem pecca¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd24a06e-372c-4535-a223-7f6fbcb18811" facs="#m-6ff3bdec-960d-41f5-a3be-85b8e2254147" label="lyrics-like">tórum eórum:</l><l xml:id="m-da97666f-64b8-4985-8b07-798a0abe49d0" facs="#m-0a28cf4a-b01e-46d4-b0b1-ec077716671f" label="lyrics-like">11. Per víscera misericórdide Déi nóstri: *in quibus visitávit nos,</l><l xml:id="m-77f52f1c-cc5e-4d26-9114-f336ab3866ce" facs="#m-c65ee0e0-6fce-415a-b215-bd97751d26e1" label="lyrics-like">óriens ex álto:</l><l xml:id="m-ff97f522-52da-4fd0-b9ef-3aef319c4c04" facs="#m-40a9879e-6097-4fd1-ba9e-1359cbec4e55" label="lyrics-like">12. Illumináre his qui in ténebris et in úmora mórtis sédent:“ad</l><l xml:id="m-ccea75c8-dcb8-4b1d-9175-e800dced4b0e" facs="#m-d03d9ce3-33da-4ff4-99ae-c0c69d2cb0c8" label="lyrics-like">dirigéndos pédes nóstros in viam pácis.</l><l xml:id="m-40984b13-4149-4531-883e-3f2d824e9d56" facs="#m-cce7d31a-bd5a-4dd6-80e9-1eb59812a9bc" label="lyrics-like">13. Glória Pâtri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-7cda5089-1b5b-4ab7-9970-6cbe50f41772" facs="#m-7ba52758-b250-42ac-a2d8-12b947690d21" label="lyrics-like">14. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d273199-6540-4aee-9d18-98a1f9edbb5e" facs="#m-ee27514b-144b-4de5-9fad-64b102007ae5" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-e52de4bb-28b0-465a-b0b8-e24df7c81680" facs="#m-6531b883-1367-47b3-bbe3-ab402fa7487b" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Concéde quaésumus. p. 367.</l><l xml:id="m-1c321cb0-6a05-4f7e-9dd3-f571e42aff0a" facs="#m-6d317818-3b10-4e6b-9745-ee5ff11c073a" label="text-like">The Cantors:</l><l xml:id="m-a7c4f75b-7880-41d0-8fbe-d82ce81b5bf2" facs="#m-70dd55cd-8b7c-4046-b3c8-006a76af8cdf" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedicámus Dómino. K. Déo grátias. p. 124.</l><l xml:id="m-3850103f-8a93-43f9-acb4-7196b9f40e3f" facs="#m-89b127ed-c21f-43e4-b2b1-11179de764cc" label="text-like">Prime is said very early; then is celebrated the Mass of Dawn, at which</l><l xml:id="m-8913a0b0-8fe6-45b1-8da2-d19c362a72a3" facs="#m-a4dce5bd-0c68-456f-8981-83b313ceb9cb" label="text-like">there is a Commemoration of S. Anastasia, Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-daa9897d-71a9-4ab3-9d67-88bbfd7abac0" facs="#m-9b5f4271-aaac-450d-b2bc-a87d85939c19" label="text-like">AT PRIME.</l><l xml:id="m-c9ef7514-682c-463a-9f9e-5e8381f263c6" facs="#m-a858ed48-a274-4b5d-934b-c9b6d7688205" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Quem vidístis. p. 395. In the Short Resp., the V. Qui nátus es de</l><l xml:id="m-f230dde0-0f0f-4bf5-ae3f-2bdc878aa16d" facs="#m-f261549c-b88f-44fe-9e72-84ab84fea93e" label="text-like">Maria Virgine. is said from this day to the Eve of the Epiphany (see p. 229).</l><l xml:id="m-55096550-1aaa-48d4-8f59-232c980da1f0" facs="#m-7b1b4ba7-27c1-4d7a-8dc6-760144b63042" label="text-like">As Short Lesson is said Ipsi peribunt. as at None, p. 41I.</l><l xml:id="m-9a450d12-3919-49a4-986d-7d208ecf28a6" facs="#m-17245808-88d0-4bc7-bd0f-d3048188689d" label="text-like">THE MASS AT DAWN.</l><l xml:id="m-0f4ef9cc-9483-4b19-b0e0-805fd1296000" facs="#m-1f0c6c5f-ffff-4f85-9f19-d065fbf8f648" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-a6468b7e-484c-4f96-8214-d63fc6e829c7" facs="#m-d6c29dbe-0c88-4a3e-82ed-afd9a899a375" label="ambiguous">3</l><l xml:id="m-2e8e0a7d-8bc5-4119-baa1-82ea4c613130" facs="#m-666d8442-ad65-4e59-b9c1-0ec87226ddd9" label="lyrics-like">UX fulgé- bit “ hó- di-e su- per nos: qui-a ná¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b133012-9b2d-46cf-95f4-3e370a1718b0" facs="#m-5af118c8-cde5-458d-9d24-bbc82596b2b5" label="lyrics-like">tus est nóbis Dó-mi-nus : et vo-cá-bi-tur Admi-rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-c064d34c-ef41-40fd-a7cf-5deb84d16ab2" facs="#m-bf7dd9a1-f112-42e1-9b57-9e198395d1db" label="ambiguous">-241</l><l xml:id="m-0c730482-ea41-4b33-bb92-38475e51d8d8" facs="#m-0680c64c-099a-42a8-aa9f-bb9a7e037300" label="lyrics-like">bi- lis, Dé- us, Prínceps pá-cis, Pá-ter futú-ri saé-cu¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>